4.  MODEL-FREE, CONVERSION-FREE, UPSILON-FREE: the deep-end slope of each stack
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  d log Delta_Sigma / d log g_bar is identical to d log g_obs / d log g_bar (B21's conversion is a constant),
  and a rigid recalibration of the abscissa by Upsilon cannot change a slope.  Predicted 1/2 unquenched, 1
  fully quenched.  Fitted jointly across the four mass bins with one shared slope and four amplitudes, using
  the full covariance restricted to the pre-specified deep window.

  PRE-SPECIFIED window (below the 2M++ break): 6 deepest g_bar bins x 4 mass bins = 24 points
