------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  [PASS] K7.0 the analytic NFW Delta_Sigma used for the LambdaCDM alternative is validated against an independent numerical projection of the same density profile -- the alternative has to be right for the comparison to mean anything   (R=0.1: 59.192 vs 59.186  R=0.5: 12.444 vs 12.445  R=2.0: 1.719 vs 1.720)
